<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bn">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>৪০৪ — পেজ পাওয়া যায়নি | NodeFlow</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Hind+Siliguri:wght@400;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #0f172a;
      color: #f8fafc;
      font-family: 'Hind Siliguri', 'Inter', sans-serif;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .error-card {
      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.5);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 3rem;
      max-width: 500px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="error-card">
    <div class="text-danger mb-4" style="font-size: 5rem;"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i></div>
    <h1 class="mb-3" style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 2.5rem; font-family: 'Inter';">404</h1>
    <h3 class="mb-3" style="font-weight: 700; font-family: 'Hind Siliguri';">পেজটি খুঁজে পাওয়া যায়নি</h3>
    <p class="text-muted mb-4" style="font-family: 'Hind Siliguri'; font-size: 0.95rem;">আপনি যে লিংকটি খুঁজছেন তা হয়তো সরানো হয়েছে অথবা আর উপলব্ধ নেই।</p>
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary" style="background: #0ea5e9; border: none; padding: 0.6rem 2rem; border-radius: 30px; font-weight: 600; font-family: 'Hind Siliguri';"><i class="fas fa-home me-2"></i> হোমে ফিরে যান</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
